{"aliases":[],"authors":[],"details":{"availability":"Source, task files, configurations and committed replays and results; archived","benchmark_protocol":{"actions":["agent-defined browser actions"],"counts":[{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nottelabs/open-operator-evals/50f8e472230cbcc9c4ff24e1e8ed5ae42683b238/eval/data/webvoyager/webvoyager_simple.jsonl","population":"WebVoyager30 (eval/data/webvoyager/webvoyager_simple.jsonl)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"tasks","value":30},{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nottelabs/open-operator-evals/50f8e472230cbcc9c4ff24e1e8ed5ae42683b238/eval/data/webvoyager/webvoyager_simple.jsonl","population":"WebVoyager30 (eval/data/webvoyager/webvoyager_simple.jsonl)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"websites","value":15},{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nottelabs/open-operator-evals/50f8e472230cbcc9c4ff24e1e8ed5ae42683b238/eval/data/webvoyager/webvoyager.jsonl","population":"full WebVoyager task file in the repository (eval/data/webvoyager/webvoyager.jsonl)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"tasks","value":643}],"evaluation":"A GPT-4o judge (default model in eval/evaluators/webvoyager.py) receives the task, the agent's final response and up to its last four screenshots under WebVoyager's evaluation prompt and returns SUCCESS, NOT SUCCESS or UNKNOWN; the agent's own success claim is recorded separately. The three published configurations (configs/) run each task 8 times with at most 20 steps and 360 seconds.","evidence_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nottelabs/open-operator-evals/HEAD/README.md","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nottelabs/open-operator-evals/50f8e472230cbcc9c4ff24e1e8ed5ae42683b238/eval/data/webvoyager/webvoyager_simple.jsonl","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nottelabs/open-operator-evals/50f8e472230cbcc9c4ff24e1e8ed5ae42683b238/eval/data/webvoyager/webvoyager.jsonl","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nottela